section(class='format-cards')
	div(class='main-container format-cards__shell')
		div(class='container format-cards__container format-cards__inner')
			h2(class='format-cards__title') Dos formas simples de sumar bienestar a tu rutina.

			div(class='format-cards__grid')
				article(class='format-cards__card format-cards__card--gomitas')
					div(class='format-cards__content')
						h3(class='format-cards__name') Gomitas
						p(class='format-cards__text') Ricas, prácticas y fáciles de sumar todos los días.
						ul(class='format-cards__list')
							li(class='format-cards__item') Vitamin - Antiox
							li(class='format-cards__item') C+Maglife - Serenity
						a(class='format-cards__cta' href='suplementos.html') Ver gomitas
					div(class='format-cards__media')
						img(class='format-cards__image' src='./assets/drive_24_julio/dos_formas/gomitas/gomitas.png' alt='Gomitas Recupé Plus' width='480' height='360' loading='lazy')

				article(class='format-cards__card format-cards__card--capsulas')
					div(class='format-cards__content')
						h3(class='format-cards__name') Cápsulas
						p(class='format-cards__text') Productos especializados con ingredientes clínicamente respaldados para tu recuperación e inmunidad.
						ul(class='format-cards__list')
							li(class='format-cards__item') Memotre - Activity
							li(class='format-cards__item') Recovery - Ave More
						a(class='format-cards__cta' href='suplementos.html') Ver cápsulas
					div(class='format-cards__media')
						img(class='format-cards__image' src='./assets/drive_24_julio/dos_formas/gomitas/gomitas.png' alt='Cápsulas Recupé Plus' width='480' height='360' loading='lazy')
